direction: down

ordinary: Ordinary JS, JSX, TS, or TSX
tsrx: TSRX bytes
scan: Linear scan
overlay: Original-span overlay
projection: Mapped legal TSX projection
buffer_map: One buffer and affine identity map
parser: OXC parser
arena: One arena AST
lint: Semantic analysis and oxc_linter
translate: Identity-only label and fix translation
diagnostics: Original TSRX diagnostics

ordinary -> parser
tsrx -> scan -> projection -> parser -> lint -> translate -> diagnostics
scan -> overlay -> lint
projection -> buffer_map -> lint
parser -> arena -> lint
